I multiply eggs × eggs-per-hen-per-year × coins-per-egg to chain the daydream into a single total.

{"tool_calls":[{"name":"eval","args":{"form":"(let [eggs 5 eggs-per-hen 55 coins-per-egg 5] (* eggs eggs-per-hen coins-per-egg))"}}]}
<|end|>


