The gap grows by (hare-speed minus tortoise-speed) each hour, so I divide miles-ahead by that gap rate.

{"tool_calls":[{"name":"eval","args":{"form":"(let [hare-speed 9 tortoise-speed 3 miles-ahead 18 gap-per-hour (- hare-speed tortoise-speed)] (quot miles-ahead gap-per-hour))"}}]}
<|end|>


