Write a Clojure expression that computes how many whole pieces of food each mouse receives if any leftover is set aside.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls":[{"name":"eval","args":{"form":"(let [total 21 n-mice 5] (quot total n-mice))"}}]}
<|end|>


