Daily revenue is per-day eggs × per-egg coins; days = total-coins / coins-per-day.

{"tool_calls":[{"name":"eval","args":{"form":"(let [per-day 1 per-egg-coins 40 total-coins 520 coins-per-day (* per-day per-egg-coins)] (quot total-coins coins-per-day))"}}]}
