I ceiling-divide the fruit's height by the per-jump height (adding per-jump minus one before quot).

{"tool_calls":[{"name":"eval","args":{"form":"(let [grape-height 10 per-jump 2] (quot (+ grape-height (dec per-jump)) per-jump))"}}]}
