On the first hard morning of winter — a season that would last 52 days in all — Chirp the grasshopper came scratching at Tic's burrow, her belly aching for food. Inside the burrow, Tic sat beside a basket of 287 crumbs and ate 2 crumbs each day. The Grasshopper had only 2 crumbs in a jar, and ate 2 crumbs a day. (No stockpile can drop below zero.)

Question: how many crumbs Tic has left at the end of winter?
