Write a Clojure expression that computes the smallest number of leaps Vix needs to reach the fruit.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls":[{"name":"eval","args":{"form":"(let [grape-height 7 per-jump 2] (quot (+ grape-height (dec per-jump)) per-jump))"}}]}
<|end|>


