I compute leftover for Toc as initial minus days times rate, then clamp to 0 if negative using max.

{"tool_calls":[{"name":"eval","args":{"form":"(let [ant-stock 254 ant-rate 2 gh-stock 21 gh-rate 3 days 69 ant-left (- ant-stock (* ant-rate days)) gh-left (- gh-stock (* gh-rate days))] (max ant-left 0))"}}]}
<|end|>


