After many seasons of false cries from the hill, an old village elder set a rule that the people held to: the villagers would answer no more than 5 false alarms from a single shepherd. Tom had so far raised 6 false alarms. Whether they would come the next time depended on a simple comparison.

Write a Clojure expression that computes whether the villagers will come on the next alarm (return the string "yes" or "no").
